&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are looking for an Employer Brand Manager to join us. &lt;/strong&gt;At Melio, our team leads the strategy and execution for Employer Branding, Employee Experience, and internal Learning initiatives. Operating across the US and Israel, we serve as the architects of Melio’s culture and reputation. We manage our global social channels, the Melio Medium blog, and our Glassdoor presence, while producing high-impact content and videos for company milestones. From hosting technical meetups and conferences to organizing local happy hours and large-scale corporate events, we ensure Melio remains a top-tier destination for talent.&lt;/p&gt;
