&lt;p&gt;The team takes their talent and experience and transform it into the standard of Melio’s backend engineering area, affecting coding excellence, From Service creation to Production monitoring&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a leader in the &lt;strong&gt;Platform Engineering &lt;/strong&gt;group, you will be responsible for serving other engineers here at Melio, by providing them with wider solution of internal services, packages and tools.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team continually improving the DevX (Developer experience) of more than 200 engineers and setting high bar of coding standards, helping the product engineering team to focus on their business oriented tasks while using the Platform Engineering solutions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position requires an experienced team leader that achieved success in their previous roles as a technical leader, that wants to add a deeper challenge, impacting other engineers besides their own team.&lt;/p&gt;
