&lt;li&gt;2+ years experience leading a team of engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of production systems and the architecture of web products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CI/CD pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of cloud infrastructure (AWS preferred but not a must)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive team player with a desire to impact other engineering teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independent, resourceful, and creative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications (If you have those, we see it as an advantage, but it&#39;s not a must)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with NodeJS/ Type script&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working in Serverless environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working closely with Devops engineers&lt;/li&gt;
