&lt;li&gt;Look for ideas of improvement of DevX&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for internal services in production - with continuous improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set goals, define tasks, and manage timelines to execute a roadmap. The team has dedicated technical product manager, and together you plan the team’s roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
