&lt;li&gt;Define and monitor KPIs to assess product performance, measure success, and prioritize features for maximum impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, maintain, and keep the integrity of a complex payment network that moves money to thousands of businesses across the US.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute the product roadmap aligned with the company’s goals to address market needs and drive innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Data, Ops, Finance &amp;amp; Engineering teams to build, deploy, and scale delightful payment experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
