&lt;li&gt;Build the business case for new products and features through market research, competitive analysis, user interviews and other stakeholder feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define key metrics to track success or prioritise features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the business as well as technical requirements for products and features. Write clear and concise product specs, feature cards, and other product documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide and work closely with engineering teams throughout the process of developing delightful payment experiences that customers love.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master the partner domain, their user behavior, workflows and jobs to be done to find the perfect context and growth opportunities for the Melio embedded solution&lt;/li&gt;
