&lt;p&gt;We are user experts and constantly analyze their current and future needs. We define the product roadmap, including features and requirements, and then articulate the business rationale behind it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team is responsible for providing the ‘what’ and working with the engineering team to build a successful product.&lt;br&gt;As part of a product team within a fintech company, you’ll have a unique opportunity to make a real impact on Melio, its product, our users and help the company scale.&lt;/p&gt;
