&lt;p&gt;With offices in New York and Tel Aviv and a vibrant work culture, Melio is expanding daily. We are a diverse group of people who love what we do and do what we love. You will fit right in if you are a driven and passionate team player. We are an equal-opportunity employer and are always on the lookout for top-notch talent—please reach out if you would like to join us on this exciting journey!&lt;/p&gt;
