&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expert Troubleshooting &amp;amp; Resolution:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the first and primary point of technical escalation during the pre- and post-launch phases. Rapidly diagnose, reproduce, and resolve initial integration hurdles, complex technical setup issues, and API usage errors.&lt;/li&gt;
