&lt;li&gt;A strong technical background with proven experience in troubleshooting and debugging complex issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshooting Specialist: Expert at using debugging tools, browser dev tools, Postman, and log aggregators (Datadog/Splunk/ELK).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in incident management, including leading cross-domain incident management efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
